  "title": {
    "zh": "栈",
    "en": "Stacks"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "栈顶与后进先出",
    "en": "The top of a stack and last in, first out"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "把维修站的电池一块块叠上去，再从顶上拿。看看新电池放到哪里，拿走后谁又成了栈顶。",
    "en": "Pile up the repair station’s batteries, then take them from the top. Watch where each new battery goes and which one is on top after a removal."
  },
  "hints": [],
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "只往栈顶放",
        "en": "Put each battery on top"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "用列表表示栈时，列表的末尾就是栈顶。每执行一次 append，新电池就放在原来那块的上面。",
        "en": "When a list represents a stack, its end is the top. Each append puts a new battery above the previous one."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "先拿最后放进去的",
        "en": "Take the last battery added"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "pop() 从末尾拿走一块电池，并把它交给程序。最晚放进去的电池在栈顶，所以最先被拿走。",
        "en": "pop() removes one battery from the end and gives it back. The last battery added is on top, so it comes out first."
      }
    },
    {
      "title": {
        "zh": "看到新的栈顶",
        "en": "Find the new top"
      },
      "body": {
        "zh": "拿走 C 后，原来在下面的 B 露出来。再拿一次就是 B，最后只剩 A。用列表记录剩余电池时，从栈底写到栈顶。",
        "en": "Taking C exposes B. The next pop gives B, leaving just A. The list of remaining batteries is written from bottom to top."
      }
    }
  ],
  "question": {
    "prompt": {
      "zh": "先放 A，再放 B，再放 C。执行一次 pop()，拿走的是哪块？",
      "en": "Put in A, then B, then C. Which battery comes out with one pop()?"
    },
